type: dataset
title: "OpenMuscle Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Labeled and raw sensor capture sessions from OpenMuscle wearable forearm
  pressure-sensing devices (FlexGrid 60-cell matrix and earlier prototypes),
  published for machine learning research on hand and forearm biomechanics.
